    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"finding a new purpose in the ashes\" feels like a lie people tell to keep others from giving up. it's not just about rebuilding... it's about the fact that the person i was when i built this is gone too. i don't see a way back to being okay. sometimes it feels like the most dignified thing to do is just to step away before the wrecking ball hits. is it really so wrong to just want to leave while there's still some dignity left?",
